The two API levels of Hugging face

    Lower level -
        It's about Tokenization and Models.
        It's a granular apis where we get to work with Deep Neural Network and It gives more power and more control

    Higher level -
        These pipelines helps us to carry out standard tasks quickly
        We can use pipelines when we want to something out-of-box, preconditioned or Inference tasks. When we run a
        model to achieve the business objective

        The common pipelines:
        1. Sentiment analysis
        2. Classifier -> Helps us to classify a person or place
        3. Named entity Recognition -> Takes a sentence and tells these are people or places
        4. Question and Answering
        5. Summarization
        6. Translation





